        "turn_id": "01a21e5c-43de-79a3-8b1e-b3e85e85de85",
        "rationale": "Fresh inference on the immutable Top7 input supplies the missing coordinates. The provided mapping fixes chain A positions 1–92 to 1QYS model 1 label positions 3–94 for the subsequent fit.",
