      },
      {
        "decision_ref": "gxa_ad4f8a198ca02c4d63f966cf5cb7e30ff8ec9ea2dd06fc6c2f1888612fe7cdf6",
        "turn_id": "01a21e67-5812-75a1-b031-418eaebf0dea",
        "rationale": "The approved AlphaFold prediction supplied the coordinates used in agreement.json. The equal-weight, proper-rotation fit used {{metric:matched_positions}} of {{metric:mapped_positions}} mapped Cα pairs and gave an RMSD of {{metric:calpha_rmsd_A}}. The matched-pair list reproduces the supplied map, including the methionine–selenomethionine pair identified in the inventory and confirmed in both coordinate files. This answers the calibration question over the entire intended fragment.",
